{"title": "未知", "index": 17, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body>\n<p class=\"title1\" id=\"CHP15\">索　引</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext3\">书中各学科专名表。名词前冠词从略</p>\n<p class=\"subtitle1\">A</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01645.jpeg\"/>（good）　善</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01650.jpeg\"/> V　善人</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01654.jpeg\"/>（ignorance）　无知</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01660.jpeg\"/> V（unknowable）　不可知的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01668.jpeg\"/> V　不成文的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01673.jpeg\"/>　不成文法</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01677.jpeg\"/> V　田地；乡间</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01682.jpeg\"/>（injustice）　不正义</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01687.jpeg\"/>（always）　永恒</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01691.jpeg\"/>ν（that which always is.）　永恒事物</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01698.jpeg\"/>　或　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01294.jpeg\"/>　吟唱</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01300.jpeg\"/> V</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00868.jpeg\"/> V　不朽的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01313.jpeg\"/>.（Our soul is immortal and never perishes.）　我们的魂是不朽不灭的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01319.jpeg\"/>　或　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01329.jpeg\"/> V（wretched）　不幸的，痛苦的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01337.jpeg\"/>　痛苦呢还是快乐</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01343.jpeg\"/>　或　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01078.jpeg\"/> V　冥王；冥国；坟墓</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01358.jpeg\"/>　冥间的事物</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01365.jpeg\"/> V（ugliness）　丑</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01193.jpeg\"/> V（sensation）　感觉</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01379.jpeg\"/>　或　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01387.jpeg\"/>　听觉，耳朵</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01320.jpeg\"/>　耳朵听的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01401.jpeg\"/> V　真，真实</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01408.jpeg\"/>（absolute truth）　绝对真实</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01414.jpeg\"/> V（irrational）　无理性的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01421.jpeg\"/>（ignorance）　愚昧无知</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01428.jpeg\"/>　较好的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01437.jpeg\"/>　优生和劣生</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01011.jpeg\"/>　必须；必然</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01016.jpeg\"/>（necessity of Diomede）　迪俄墨得斯的必须</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01021.jpeg\"/> V（unharmonious）　不和谐的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01028.jpeg\"/>　不和谐</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01037.jpeg\"/>　不和谐</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01044.jpeg\"/> V（brave）　勇敢的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01049.jpeg\"/> V　人像雕刻师</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01055.jpeg\"/>　不知，无知</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01061.jpeg\"/>（man）　人，男人，勇敢的人</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01067.jpeg\"/> V　人</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01073.jpeg\"/> V　人天性中的人性部分</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01747.jpeg\"/> V　向上的道路，上升过程</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01082.jpeg\"/> V　不像，不一致</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01087.jpeg\"/>（controvert）　反驳</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01092.jpeg\"/>　争吵，争论</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01098.jpeg\"/>（art of contradiction）　争论艺术</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01103.jpeg\"/> V　高于假设的，不需要假</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">设的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01109.jpeg\"/>　高于假设的世界</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01116.jpeg\"/>（unevenness）　不平，不平衡</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01124.jpeg\"/>　打死，判死刑</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01130.jpeg\"/>　银子；银币；钱</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01703.jpeg\"/>（virtue）　美德</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　　　　善</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　　　　至善</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01709.jpeg\"/>　数数目</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01717.jpeg\"/>（number）　数目</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01724.jpeg\"/>（aristocracy）　贵族政治</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01730.jpeg\"/>（harmony）　和音</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　　　　　　声调</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　　　　　　曲调</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01737.jpeg\"/>（the bad rhythm）　坏的节奏</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01742.jpeg\"/>（even）　偶致</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01748.jpeg\"/>（first principle）　原理；起点</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01757.jpeg\"/>　绝对原理；总起点</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01764.jpeg\"/>　前提，起点</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　权力</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01770.jpeg\"/>（ruler）　统治者</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01776.jpeg\"/> V（subject）　（被统治的）人民，老百姓</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01783.jpeg\"/>（weakness）　软弱无力</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01787.jpeg\"/>　公民，（雅典）城市居民（区别于只有公民权而无政治权的<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01794.jpeg\"/> V）</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01801.jpeg\"/>（star）　天体</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　　　　星体</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01805.jpeg\"/>（astronomy）　天文学</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01811.jpeg\"/>　丑</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01816.jpeg\"/>　长笛</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01819.jpeg\"/>　（雅典法律）剥夺公民权</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01826.jpeg\"/>　或　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01440.jpeg\"/>　增大</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01447.jpeg\"/>　第二维（第三维）</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01669.jpeg\"/>　消灭掉，除去</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01701.jpeg\"/>　谋害人命</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01739.jpeg\"/>　无智，不智</p>\n<p class=\"subtitle1\">B</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01779.jpeg\"/> V（depth）　厚度，深度，高度</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01814.jpeg\"/>　重的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01487.jpeg\"/>（royalty）　王政</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00810.jpeg\"/>　最好的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00846.jpeg\"/>　心灵的最善部分</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01507.jpeg\"/> V（aid）　助手</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00917.jpeg\"/>（willing）　希望</p>\n<p class=\"subtitle1\">Γ</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01521.jpeg\"/> V　成文的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01526.jpeg\"/>　成文法</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01533.jpeg\"/>　种，血统</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01539.jpeg\"/>（generation and decay）　产生与灭亡</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01548.jpeg\"/> V（genesis）　产生世界，变化世界</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01556.jpeg\"/> V　产生，家族，种，类</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01563.jpeg\"/>　四种人：金种、银种、铜种、铁种</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01571.jpeg\"/> V（well-born）　出身高贵的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01579.jpeg\"/>（geometry）　几何学</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01135.jpeg\"/>　农业</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01142.jpeg\"/>（the world of becoming and passing away）　生灭世界</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01149.jpeg\"/> V（knowable）　可知的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01154.jpeg\"/>　体操</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01162.jpeg\"/>（angle）　角（几何图）</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01169.jpeg\"/>（three kinds of angles）　三种角</p>\n<p class=\"subtitle1\">Δ</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01176.jpeg\"/> V（dactyl）　（诗的）长短　短格的（节奏）</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01184.jpeg\"/> V（borrowing）　借贷</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01192.jpeg\"/> V（strange prisoner）　奇特的囚徒</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01200.jpeg\"/>（democracy）　民主制度</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01206.jpeg\"/> V（the democratic）　民主分子</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01213.jpeg\"/> V（populace）　人民</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　　　　　　平民</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01221.jpeg\"/>　讨论，交谈</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01227.jpeg\"/>（by the power of dialectics）　凭着辩证的力量</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01234.jpeg\"/> V（dialectic）　言语，谈话</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01244.jpeg\"/>（dialecticians）　辩证法家</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01252.jpeg\"/>（diagonal）　对角线</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01259.jpeg\"/>　思想</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01266.jpeg\"/>　思想和意见</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01274.jpeg\"/>（mind or understanding）　理智</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01280.jpeg\"/> V　叙述（文体）</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01178.jpeg\"/>（by pure narration）　单用叙述</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01230.jpeg\"/> V　酒神赞美歌</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01239.jpeg\"/> V　正义者</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01247.jpeg\"/>（justice）　正义，公正</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01255.jpeg\"/> V（judge, jury）　法官，审判员，公证人，陪审员</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01262.jpeg\"/>　或　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01271.jpeg\"/>（thirst）　干渴</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01277.jpeg\"/>　意见</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　信念</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　荣誉</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01283.jpeg\"/>（the opinable to the know able）　可意见世界与可知识世界的比</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01136.jpeg\"/> V（slave）　奴隶</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01143.jpeg\"/> V（potency, quality）　品质，能力</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01150.jpeg\"/>　政权；国家；世袭的君主国</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01155.jpeg\"/>　二</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01163.jpeg\"/>　用多利亚调</p>\n<p class=\"subtitle1\">E</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01170.jpeg\"/>（praise）　赞辞</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01177.jpeg\"/>　赞美好人的颂诗</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01186.jpeg\"/>　愿望</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01349.jpeg\"/> V（form）　种</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　（idea）　概念</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　（form, idea）　形式或理念</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01201.jpeg\"/> V, <img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01208.jpeg\"/> V（known）　已知的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01215.jpeg\"/>（conjecture）　想象</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01222.jpeg\"/>（image）　影像</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　（comparison）　譬喻</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00966.jpeg\"/>　用譬喻说话</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00973.jpeg\"/>　控诉、审理和争讼</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　