/image01454.jpeg\"/> V（appetitive）　欲望的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01457.jpeg\"/> V　热爱者</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01460.jpeg\"/> V　智慧的爱好者</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01464.jpeg\"/>（appetite）欲望</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01466.jpeg\"/> V（helper）　辅助者</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01470.jpeg\"/> V　帮助者和统治者</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01473.jpeg\"/>　或　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01477.jpeg\"/>　（科学）知识</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01481.jpeg\"/>　习惯，风俗</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01485.jpeg\"/>　法律和习惯</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00774.jpeg\"/> V（pursuit）　职业</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01491.jpeg\"/>　报酬</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01493.jpeg\"/> V（epic）　史诗</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01497.jpeg\"/>　问</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01501.jpeg\"/>　问答</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01504.jpeg\"/>　反对派，反对党人</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00882.jpeg\"/>　伟人</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　　幸福的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　　　　　快乐的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01510.jpeg\"/> V（repute）　名，令名</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01515.jpeg\"/>　（身体）坚强有力</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01518.jpeg\"/> V　直的</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\">　<img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image00837.jpeg\"/>　直的（东西）</p>\n<p class=\"normaltext4\"><img alt=\"alt\" src=\"../Images/image01524.jpeg\"/> V（the good r